## Command

```shell
biome lint --only=nursery/useTailwindSortedClasses '<TEMP_DIR>/nested_configs_resolve_tailwind_stylesheet'
```

## `admin/biome.json`

```json
{ "root": false, "extends": "//", "tailwind": { "stylesheet": "./admin.css" } }
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "root": true,
  "tailwind": { "stylesheet": "./web/app.css" },
  "linter": { "rules": { "nursery": { "useTailwindSortedClasses": "error" } } }
}
```

## `web/biome.json`

```json
{ "root": false, "extends": "//" }
```

## `admin/App.jsx`

```jsx
export const a = <div className="bg-admin flex" />;
export const b = <div className="bg-brand flex" />;

```

## `admin/admin.css`

```css
@import "tailwindcss";
@theme { --color-admin: #f00; }
```

## `plain/App.jsx`

```jsx
export const a = <div className="bg-brand flex" />;

```

## `web/App.jsx`

```jsx
export const a = <div className="bg-brand flex" />;

```

## `web/app.css`

```css
@import "tailwindcss";
@theme { --color-brand: #00f; }
```

